OL,3,GNEWSAGroup collects 2 tonnes of marine
OL,4,Alitter in Scilly
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than two tonnes of litter has been
OL,7,Fpicked up from the Isles of Scilly
OL,8,Fcoastline in the past 18 months,
OL,9,Faccording to a community group.
OL,11,FScilly Coastal Clean-up, which has been
OL,12,Fsorting marine debris since February
OL,13,F2025, said the haul included 8,000
OL,14,Fplastic bottles and 16,000 pieces of
OL,15,Frope and netting.
OL,17,FDirector Nikki Banfield said: "Scilly
OL,18,Fis at the mercy of the wind and the
OL,19,Ftides. Each rise and fall means fresh
OL,20,Fdebris is deposited around our
OL,21,Fcoastlines.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
