OL,3,GNEWSAGroup collects 2 tonnes of marine
OL,4,Alitter in Scilly
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The majority, around 98%, comes from
OL,7,Ffar beyond our islands and can be
OL,8,Ftraced to the mainland UK, Europe,
OL,9,FAfrica, America, Canada and further
OL,10,Fafield as a result of global shipping."
